# Forbidden Systems

Do not add any of these, even as stubs, placeholders, or “later” features:

- Training
- Auto Combine / Manual Combine / Fusion / Merge
- Evolution (level, material, form, upgrade)
- Hero Level
- Hero Loss / Hero Death / extra raid penalty
- Extra main currencies
- Direct Hero → Gold production

Heroes stay individual. Progression is new recruits, facility upgrades, raids, and optional sell-at-a-loss.

Sell / Release is allowed. Refund is at most 25% of Accept Fee. Do not treat sell as Combine or as raid hero-loss.

```lua
-- ❌ BAD
local function combineHeroes(heroes) end

-- ✅ GOOD
-- Each accepted candidate becomes its own Hero. No merge path.
```
